### Runtime BC — 语音拨号前预检(2026-08-24)
###
### 契约:     docs/api/live-audio-client-contract-v1.0.md §3.1.1
### 实现:     internal/runtime/port/http/live_handler.go (Quote)
###           internal/runtime/app/service/live_quote.go
###
### 用途:
###   主: 详情页 T0 费用展示数据源 — 单价/余额/可通话分钟, 服务端权威计算,
###       单价在拨号前唯一可查面; 可据此拨号前就把按钮切「去充值」态
###   兜底: 握手栈取不到状态码的实现用它判因 (2026-08-24 勘误: xing_yuan 实测
###       可直读握手 402 + body code=40200, 判因首选直读, 契约 §3.1)
###
### 纯读零副作用(不冻结/不占租约/不建上游连接), 可反复调用。
### 硬闸仍在 WS 握手(Admit): 预检说可拨、拨号时余额已花掉, 握手照样 402。
###
### env 变量: see docs/api/http-requests/http-client.env.json
###   - {{base_url}}     e.g. http://localhost:8080
###   - {{access_token}} JWT
###   - {{app_id}} + {{app_signature}}  see cmd/signtool

############################################
# 拨号前预检
############################################

# @name liveQuote
GET {{base_url}}/v1/live/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
X-App-ID: {{app_id}}
X-App-Signature: {{app_signature}}

### 响应形态(计费模式 · 余额不足 → 客户端弹购买):
# {
#   "code": 0,
#   "data": {
#     "available": false,
#     "reason": "insufficient_credits",
#     "credit_per_minute": 12,
#     "balance_credits": 0,
#     "callable_minutes": 0,
#     "max_duration_seconds": 2700
#   }
# }
#
### 响应形态(计费模式 · 余额充足):
# { "data": { "available": true, "credit_per_minute": 12,
#             "balance_credits": 100, "callable_minutes": 8,
#             "max_duration_seconds": 2700 } }
#
### 响应形态(免费模式 — 费用三字段**缺席**, 客户端隐藏全部费用 UI):
# { "data": { "available": true, "max_duration_seconds": 2700 } }
#
### 响应形态(面未开启/配置不完整 — 确定性, 客户端隐藏语音入口):
# { "data": { "available": false, "reason": "unavailable" } }
#
### 基础设施故障(可重试, **不要**据此弹购买):
# { "code": 50323, "message": "voice sessions are temporarily unavailable" }
